                       ISO29110V2:isTaskOf ISO29110V2:SI.ACT.02 ;
                       ISO29110V2:hasTaskDescription """Validate and obtain approval from the customer of the software Requirement specification:
- Make corrections until the document is approved by the customer.""" ;
                       ISO29110V2:hasTaskID "SI.2.4" ;
                       ISO29110V2:hasTaskNote "NOTE 1: Software Requirement specification have to satisfy the needs and the agreed expectations/ including the user interface usability." ,
                                              "NOTE 2: The results of the validation are documented in the validation record." ,
                                              "NOTE 3: Conditional task: Initiate a change request if significant changes (those affecting project delivery schedule/ project costs/ etc.) were needed." .


