- Backup and recovery mechanisms defined
- Storage, handling and delivery (including archival and retrieval) mechanisms specified""" ;
                     ISO29110V2:hasWorkProductCharacteristicName "Project Plan" ;
                     ISO29110V2:hasWorkProductCharacteristicNote "Signed by customer and project manager" .


